SUMMARY:Pumpkin Madness Festival – Cherry-Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:How many ways you can bid farewell to a pumpkin? Join us as we 
 embark on a thrilling quest to discover the ultimate pumpkin destruction t
 echniques. From smashing and throwing to bowling\, dropping\, and carving\
 , there’s no shortage of excitement as we embark on this pumpkin demolit
 ion journey together. Bring along your leftover Halloween pumpkins or use 
 some of ours – the choice is yours! So\, gather your friends and family\
 , and get ready to make memories. Let the smashing begin! Festival Highlig
 hts: Pumpkin Smashing Pumpkin Bowling Pumpkin Putt-Putt Pumpkin Chucking A
  HUGE Pumpkin Drop at 5:00pm! Live Music Local Winery & Brewery The excite
